00:19:32,277 --> 00:19:44,277
Oh, Luffy! You're losing so much blood from that wound! We need to get you to a doctor!

278
00:19:44,277 --> 00:20:02,277
Yeah, well... It's okay, really... Just as long... As the ship is stopped... I'm just glad... Everyone... Is safe now...

279
00:20:02,277 --> 00:20:04,277
Help me!

280
00:20:08,277 --> 00:20:09,277
He'll be alright...

281
00:20:09,277 --> 00:20:22,277
I gotta admit... That there is one hell of a human!

282
00:20:22,277 --> 00:20:26,277
Yeah, to say the least... He sure is strong, isn't he?

283
00:20:26,277 --> 00:20:34,277
Even if we had been late... The island would have been saved... At the cost of the Noah being completely destroyed, of course...

284
00:20:37,277 --> 00:20:45,277
Well, it's a good thing we did make it then! I sure am glad that Princess Shirahoshi called out to us like that... Just in time...

285
00:20:45,277 --> 00:20:50,277
But I didn't do anything at all! I was just sad!

286
00:20:50,277 --> 00:20:58,277
Not quite... Your will and the will of the human echoed as one becoming a wish... A prayer to us...

287
00:21:02,277 --> 00:21:11,277
Your desire to save your people was so strong, and we all heard it loud and clear... You're not nearly as helpless as you think...

288
00:21:15,277 --> 00:21:35,277
The power of the Sea Kings... Is yours as well... If you are in need... Then we shall heed your call...

289
00:21:45,277 --> 00:22:04,277
People of the Kingdom... I'm not sure what just happened here... I'm not even sure if I can describe it... But... Whatever it was... It happened...

290
00:22:05,277 --> 00:22:08,277
The Noah... It's been stopped!

291
00:22:11,277 --> 00:22:14,277
And it's damaged... But not destroyed...

292
00:22:16,277 --> 00:22:20,277
Freshman Island... Has been saved!

293
00:22:21,277 --> 00:22:23,277
I knew Straw Hat would save us!

294
00:22:26,277 --> 00:22:27,277
He did it!

295
00:22:28,277 --> 00:22:29,277
It's finally over!

296
00:22:32,277 --> 00:22:34,277
Straw Hat!

297
00:22:35,277 --> 00:22:36,277
What a relief!

298
00:22:36,277 --> 00:22:53,277
Fight!

299
00:22:53,277 --> 00:22:58,277
1

300
00:23:06,277 --> 00:23:13,277
Horty is vanquished, the knower is stopped, and Fishman Island is saved.

301
00:23:13,277 --> 00:23:16,277
Unfortunately, Luffy was gravely injured in the process.

302
00:23:16,277 --> 00:23:19,277
Just as the Fishmen reached toward the future,

303
00:23:19,277 --> 00:23:23,277
a nagging memory of the past could cost their savior his life.

304
00:23:23,277 --> 00:23:26,277
With no time to spare, a true friend steps forward

305
00:23:26,277 --> 00:23:29,277
to tear down the walls of the island's history.

306
00:23:29,277 --> 00:23:33,277
On the next One Piece To The Future, The Path To The Sun,

307
00:23:33,277 --> 00:23:35,277
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

